msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫His eyebrows were furrowed, creating deep creases on his "
"forehead."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Le sue sopracciglia aggrottate creavano profonde rughe "
"sulla sua fronte."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D45B5FCA_5D60_4431_BFFF_60E9F8A95EDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8280706751e49be6865b1f19fd37129fb20c785cc42c78a22696e7bcae32de59
#. default-sha256: 87c8b54d9fde0446ffacf9d1c64bb51537d9ae709470534924a119c58854cb39
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D45B5FCA_5D60_4431_BFFF_60E9F8A95EDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Several servants stood off to the side, watching their master attentively as he stomped past "
"them down the corridor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Diverse serve si scansarono da un lato, osservando attentamente il padrone di casa mentre le "
"superava marciando lungo il corridoio."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DB23B185_3C98_4A22_961D_7F78A5D37274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ab712c9061679798c4812b3d71553d605f439d63adfe7ec518b5adc3fc9032b
#. default-sha256: 2fe232878eb46c80872f8dc002a5453fff345cd2b59b76ae6bec1258373e1ec6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DB23B185_3C98_4A22_961D_7F78A5D37274"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, no one said a word to him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, nessuna di loro disse una parola."

#: scenario3:scenario3_621886FE_B154_42C2_95E1_319ABE98F6A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08572dbb142ff67028d69b5eb406dca3736cb41c2be0813c7fe624c4d1712317
#. default-sha256: 9a2a2ec08255c3180d39b360a50008cc7eba4b414b826b41be3715739aacf80c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_621886FE_B154_42C2_95E1_319ABE98F6A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Had I not been preoccupied attending to his countryman..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se solo non fossi stata occupata ad accompagnare il suo connazionale..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7E2E929C_3397_45DA_9D13_F550D9D64B36
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d8ac6c689da1f76bfeca6904d24e8f0a14495815374dfe26d0adb0a320c956a
#. default-sha256: 5b4c181c514d07475498482bd7ffb55c821567347218ca5f232c34d898366275
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7E2E929C_3397_45DA_9D13_F550D9D64B36"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I likely could have prevented it. ⟪k:1⟫The look on his face would have made it obvious "
"something bad was about to happen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫avrei potuto impedirlo. ⟪k:1⟫La sua espressione faceva ben capire che stava per succedere "
"qualcosa di brutto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DB124CDA_06A0_40A4_B48D_4C788CC3C5C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7eb0c81fd0966e6e3833f5167f018c1a2af515320016bd36e59bba0797ddb38
#. default-sha256: 950fbcf4a6e7de3dcf34aa3fd576005e6854da68f22e0c087a90b40914700477
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DB124CDA_06A0_40A4_B48D_4C788CC3C5C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Something that would serve only to further her misfortune."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Qualcosa che non avrebbe fatto altro che aggravare la tristezza della Ragazza dai Capelli "
"Bianchi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AD6C8D50_71DF_468B_BB0E_28D21C6CED84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43a8ae7f533049f5639097d83a3467ff6b91bcf8d1156ae0f8c5a2708fe85dec
#. default-sha256: 4300634f5cd3ed58ed65d80d19f1a80bed3152d8fd1be9c45591c6aede6bb704
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AD6C8D50_71DF_468B_BB0E_28D21C6CED84"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was already in a less-than-ideal situation..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La sua situazione era già tutt’altro che ideale..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9DD0CD29_9AA8_4F02_95D7_5BFA9472D9BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac5e3f330f8c80c0db39b525008356b229b9cf7700696794c92f6a0f55d11fe6
#. default-sha256: e70b16544110426377951ec94ab78498b324e4479d580f670f58151325dc3ece
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9DD0CD29_9AA8_4F02_95D7_5BFA9472D9BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and it was perched on the edge of a hill, soon to begin rolling down into even worse "
"territory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ed era sull’orlo di un precipizio, in attesa di rotolare giù verso territori persino "
"peggiori."

