#: scenario3:scenario3_458D4615_C573_4AFB_8C6F_895C44935729
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7b255b8dfa423a48b6222c70f7ebeee9b66358d563613ee2bd7c76c9b7e19ed
