#: scenario3:scenario3_50F2B486_E343_43DE_BD33_53EBE3D9369B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c180943a772961b08c5e50718f4ca4d91591ca039149549d83b54332d1c1cec
#. default-sha256: f6e9ca773696a3de2e6f297ffed2e2866bf366688a3a6fd9c2cb208adb180ab8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_50F2B486_E343_43DE_BD33_53EBE3D9369B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Is there something you so "
"desperately want to keep from me that I must ⟪k:12⟫knock⟪k:13⟫ before entering?! That I should "
"have to let you know in advance that I’m coming?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫C’è qualcosa che nascondi così "
"disperatamente perché io debba ⟪k:12⟫bussare⟪k:13⟫ prima di entrare?! Così da farti sapere in "
"anticipo che sto arrivando?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C21552BE_DC90_4421_84B0_475F9A495E98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93f1f39417c7eeb93faca122660347b698d408e808b3404dc01eb1262b5d7a60
