msgid "⟪k:0⟫Wh-⟪k:1⟫What— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What are you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫D-⟪k:1⟫Di cosa— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Di cosa stai—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BB18F7D5_9D06_4F75_9ADC_BDE7A2B489CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13dd7de0fd9e6b8bcf849e1591522e44d0c027e55386502e22fdb01580e9c138
#. default-sha256: dd5040762dba4813a70cdf7bfe8ce681dc959194751b0cb2c721320e3ec1e37c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BB18F7D5_9D06_4F75_9ADC_BDE7A2B489CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Well?! ⟪k:1⟫Is there?!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You went to talk to ⟪k:5⟫him⟪k:6⟫ behind my back, I’m "
"told!⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫What’d you tell him?! You moan to him about my behavior?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ebbene?! ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫È⟪k:3⟫ così?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Mi è stato detto che sei andata a parlare con "
"⟪k:7⟫lui⟪k:8⟫ alle mie spalle!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Cosa gli hai detto?! Ti sei lamentata del mio "
"comportamento?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F67CBE6B_5A5D_4BDC_85B5_C83332780DB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77aa7bdd264afed08a70ba02712144e4ba61aa2a523c7b9326b7952f11bd0cb4
#. default-sha256: 70a9508ccd03c0e061068163dfcac8b5b9545489038947f6a9fc29b9d033c114
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F67CBE6B_5A5D_4BDC_85B5_C83332780DB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫—?! ⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ah—! ⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Ngh, ⟪k:17⟫that hurts!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫—?! ⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ah—! ⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Ngh, ⟪k:17⟫mi fai male!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_56133238_9AFE_46C2_AE40_146A4E02CA49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7904d1476c2163f12f9eb1aff69cb4324d0e09d0e7f4209b3fb3bd51f7d693e8
#. default-sha256: b64b320fa9c1ae4a7f515a5f6ff0a33e7a2f7edff36a7d8d41091f45979798d1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_56133238_9AFE_46C2_AE40_146A4E02CA49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You told him I’m rough with you?!⟪k:1⟫You cried on his shoulder because I’m not ⟪k:2⟫nice "
"enough⟪k:3⟫?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Him!⟪k:7⟫ Of all people!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Gli hai detto che sono rude con te?!⟪k:1⟫Hai pianto sulla sua spalla perché non sono ⟪k:2⟫"
"abbastanza carino⟪k:3⟫ con te?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Proprio ⟪k:6⟫lui⟪k:7⟫! Tra tutte le persone!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A545B7E9_6952_4FD5_8931_2C61301376E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f22c0700ffb957f66d262b2855251efbcb4e2791ecd32d17d137d1555b68df0c
#. default-sha256: 2348dc08fdcd30ee20980ec62e81c90d504fce23b7c3a3b0de1dbbd8b4014f45
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A545B7E9_6952_4FD5_8931_2C61301376E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫W-⟪k:13⟫Wait, Jacopo!⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫You’re mistaken! Let me—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫A-⟪k:13⟫Aspetta, Jacopo!⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫Ti stai sbagliando! Lascia che io—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74215A9D_29DA_4DAD_9359_CD732F2F5186
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d9f02164ed3dc4f903a29bc2778872f4df57b9d8a525e18793ed46a52691f31
#. default-sha256: bd1f9dd46617d84f67b0f159647d748236b80aacc181024a531d3beb5eac2dd3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74215A9D_29DA_4DAD_9359_CD732F2F5186"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Silence! Not a word! Not a single godforsaken word!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The only thing that comes out "
"of your mouth is excuses!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Lies and fabrication!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Silenzio! Non dire una parola! Nemmeno una fottuta parola!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dalla tua bocca non "
"escono altro che scuse!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Bugie e montature!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1101EC98_EE9E_4344_AE98_E834C4B1E946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2a160774a4cb952277e809480c610a2978c8c6b6a069e4c99029d8ae45b81db
#. default-sha256: fef9b256f9da50cde9941a6df4bf09e840917f7710b11945fa753dd967a3420f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1101EC98_EE9E_4344_AE98_E834C4B1E946"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You put on this sweet, innocent little girl act,⟪k:1⟫but what’s ⟪k:2⟫really⟪k:3⟫ going "
"through your head?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Maybe I should just rip that mask off your face!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hai messo su questa recita da dolce ragazzina innocente,⟪k:1⟫ma cos’è che ti passa ⟪k:2⟫"
"davvero⟪k:3⟫ per la testa?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Forse dovrei soltanto strappare quella maschera dalla tua "
"faccia!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_56598359_5762_4D24_92A8_0AE6BDD415E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1047900945a1ddf19f7d836a11ca17ac1893a03542c7d38d9b3db5c951ed82a
