msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A few days later, Jacopo dragged the White-Haired Girl from her chamber and led her outside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pochi giorni dopo, Jacopo trascinò la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi fuori dalla sua camera, e "
"la condusse all’esterno."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AC628E14_3C30_4C3C_A13F_2A0EEEFC1E80
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b06c5f414a1672bf0ef825be8b7321b2b7c9936a8acc2f5f4e142aa2e51147e
