msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F9362665_BD54_4C0F_B21F_451E3F603195"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It had become a dreary space, nary a rose in sight, and being taken there did nothing to "
"improve her mood—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫only sadden her further."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era diventato uno spazio squallido, senza alcuna rosa in vista,⟪k:1⟫ed essere portata lì non "
"fece nulla per migliorare il suo stato d’animo—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫l’aveva solo rattristata "
"ulteriormente."

#: scenario3:scenario3_61079D56_4542_4990_8766_A2AE1BF1EC91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac2e11fdf855712acac19c4d3ed4a90d39c03761edd7c626c8300037d5553982
