msgid "⟪k:0⟫The cold, gray piles of metal freckling the barren earth seemed to mock her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le fredde e grigie cataste di metallo disseminate sul terreno arido sembravano deriderla."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D978C32B_3555_49A5_AB4A_7E641F827FCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3e47e82fb14f386808f0bf647aa5ec42d8bbeb311eb36f2186c26d2d42dc49b
