"⟪k:0⟫Her husband led her, the lady of the house, to a shed that had been repurposed into a "
"spartan living area."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo la portò in un capanno che era stato riadattato in un soggiorno alquanto spartano."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EB442515_00B6_4152_AE53_232CC359D0A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20e72d1655e4ae6ce93f9e081c7616fadac2397c7b320cd2e8a4e64e22c48449
