msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She begged and pleaded, but Jacopo would not have it. He shoved her into the sad little "
"shack..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lei lo supplicò, lo implorò, ma lui non volle sentire ragioni.⟪k:1⟫La spinse nella piccola "
"baracca..."

